WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.210
Hey, Pete! Who’s your friend?

2
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.630
She is Anna. She is new to D.C.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.590
Where are you from?

4
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.730
I am from a small town.

5
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:10.410
Well, welcome to D.C.

6
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:11.710
Thank you.

7
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.810
I am Jonathan. I am in apartment B4.

8
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:19.530
I am in apartment C2. Marsha is my roommate.

9
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.810
I know Marsha. She is nice.

10
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.810
And I am in Apartment D7. I have to go now.

11
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:29.650
Oh!

12
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.630
Remember to call Marsha at work. Tell her you’re here.

13
00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.790
Right, thanks, Pete. Nice to meet you!

14
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.070
You too, Bye.

15
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.400
Apartment C2, here I come!
